areContract.CameraPermissionState.Granted) {\n loadCameraInfo()\n }\n }\n\n}"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_01XifzCGK6Cru1hpKFcXp1FV","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

