## ✅ Bottom Navigation Bar Implementation

### **Key Features Implemented:**

#### 1. **Modern Bottom Navigation**
- **Material Design 3** NavigationBar component
- **5 Main Sections** with appropriate icons:
 - **Overview** (Home icon)
 - **Hardware** (Memory icon) 
 - **System** (Computer icon)
 - **Network** (WiFi icon)
 - **Sensors** (Sensors icon)

#### 2. **Smart Show/Hide Logic** ⭐
- **Always Visible** on main screens (Overview, Hardware, System, Network, Sensors)
- **Hidden** on detail screens:
 - NetworkMonitoringScreen
 - SensorDetailsScreen
- **Automatic Detection** using navigation destination

#### 3. **Proper Navigation State**
- **Active State Highlighting** - selected tab is highlighted
- **State Preservation** - maintains scroll positions when switching tabs
- **Single Instance** - prevents duplicate screens in back stack

#### 4. **Clean Architecture**
- **Consolidated Navigation** - moved all navigation logic into MainNavigation.kt
- **Removed Old Files** - deleted obsolete NavigationGraph.kt
- **Better Organization** - separated concerns with helper composables

### **How the Hide/Show Logic Works:**

```kotlin
val shouldShowBottomBar by remember {
 derivedStateOf {
 when {
 currentDestination?.hasRoute<NetworkMonitoringRoute>() == true -> false
 currentDestination?.hasRoute<SensorDetailsRoute>() == true -> false
 else -> true
 }
 }
}
```

### **Navigation Behavior:**

#### **Main Screens (Bottom Bar Visible):**
- Overview Screen
- Hardware Screen 
- System Screen
- Network Screen
- Sensors Screen

#### **Detail Screens (Bottom Bar Hidden):**
- **Network Monitoring Screen** - Full screen for monitoring
- **Sensor Details Screen** - Full screen for sensor data
- Any future detail screens you add

### **User Experience Benefits:**

1. **Modern Look** - Follows current Android design standards
2. **Always Accessible** - Main sections always one tap away
3. **Immersive Details** - Detail screens get full screen space
4. **Intuitive** - Users expect bottom navigation in system apps
5. **Thumb Friendly** - Easy to reach on large phones

### **Visual Improvements:**
- **Clean Icons** - Meaningful icons for each section
- **Bold Selected State** - Clear visual feedback
- **Proper Spacing** - Material Design spacing
- **Smooth Transitions** - Native navigation animations

The bottom navigation bar will now provide a much more modern and user-friendly navigation experience compared to the old scrollable tabs, with smart hiding behavior for detail screens!"}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"
